{"lines": [{"id": "01", "start": 8, "end": 53, "text": "Stop editing your Reels.", "words": [{"w": "Stop", "s": 8, "e": 16}, {"w": "editing", "s": 20, "e": 29}, {"w": "your", "s": 31, "e": 34}, {"w": "Reels.", "s": 37, "e": 53}]}, {"id": "02", "start": 70, "end": 136, "text": "You can hand Claude a 6-block brief instead.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 70, "e": 72}, {"w": "can", "s": 72, "e": 76}, {"w": "hand", "s": 77, "e": 83}, {"w": "Claude", "s": 85, "e": 94}, {"w": "a", "s": 95, "e": 98}, {"w": "6-block", "s": 101, "e": 114}, {"w": "brief", "s": 116, "e": 122}, {"w": "instead.", "s": 124, "e": 136}]}, {"id": "03", "start": 156, "end": 251, "text": "This Reel is the proof. I never opened an editing app.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 156, "e": 161}, {"w": "Reel", "s": 166, "e": 174}, {"w": "is", "s": 176, "e": 179}, {"w": "the", "s": 180, "e": 182}, {"w": "proof.", "s": 184, "e": 196}, {"w": "I", "s": 203, "e": 205}, {"w": "never", "s": 210, "e": 220}, {"w": "opened", "s": 223, "e": 230}, {"w": "an", "s": 231, "e": 233}, {"w": "editing", "s": 235, "e": 244}, {"w": "app.", "s": 246, "e": 251}]}, {"id": "04", "start": 270, "end": 403, "text": "Here's the brief that made it, block by block, so you can copy every line into your own.", "words": [{"w": "Here's", "s": 270, "e": 277}, {"w": "the", "s": 278, "e": 280}, {"w": "brief", "s": 281, "e": 287}, {"w": "that", "s": 288, "e": 292}, {"w": "made", "s": 294, "e": 299}, {"w": "it,", "s": 300, "e": 303}, {"w": "block", "s": 311, "e": 319}, {"w": "by", "s": 320, "e": 324}, {"w": "block,", "s": 326, "e": 336}, {"w": "so", "s": 342, "e": 344}, {"w": "you", "s": 346, "e": 348}, {"w": "can", "s": 349, "e": 352}, {"w": "copy", "s": 354, "e": 364}, {"w": "every", "s": 367, "e": 373}, {"w": "line", "s": 376, "e": 383}, {"w": "into", "s": 385, "e": 390}, {"w": "your", "s": 391, "e": 395}, {"w": "own.", "s": 397, "e": 403}]}, {"id": "05", "start": 422, "end": 533, "text": "One: who it's for. Mine: people who build things with AI.", "words": [{"w": "One:", "s": 422, "e": 429}, {"w": "who", "s": 438, "e": 440}, {"w": "it's", "s": 442, "e": 447}, {"w": "for.", "s": 449, "e": 456}, {"w": "Mine:", "s": 467, "e": 475}, {"w": "people", "s": 484, "e": 491}, {"w": "who", "s": 493, "e": 497}, {"w": "build", "s": 499, "e": 505}, {"w": "things", "s": 506, "e": 514}, {"w": "with", "s": 515, "e": 519}, {"w": "AI.", "s": 522, "e": 533}]}, {"id": "06", "start": 550, "end": 630, "text": "Two: the script, one line per voice file.", "words": [{"w": "Two:", "s": 550, "e": 557}, {"w": "the", "s": 569, "e": 571}, {"w": "script,", "s": 574, "e": 583}, {"w": "one", "s": 593, "e": 598}, {"w": "line", "s": 599, "e": 606}, {"w": "per", "s": 608, "e": 611}, {"w": "voice", "s": 614, "e": 620}, {"w": "file.", "s": 622, "e": 630}]}, {"id": "07", "start": 647, "end": 753, "text": "Three: the look. Colours as hex codes, fonts by name.", "words": [{"w": "Three:", "s": 647, "e": 655}, {"w": "the", "s": 668, "e": 670}, {"w": "look.", "s": 673, "e": 681}, {"w": "Colours", "s": 688, "e": 698}, {"w": "as", "s": 700, "e": 703}, {"w": "hex", "s": 704, "e": 711}, {"w": "codes,", "s": 712, "e": 722}, {"w": "fonts", "s": 731, "e": 739}, {"w": "by", "s": 741, "e": 744}, {"w": "name.", "s": 746, "e": 753}]}, {"id": "08", "start": 768, "end": 861, "text": "Mine are on screen: Archivo, and mint green.", "words": [{"w": "Mine", "s": 768, "e": 774}, {"w": "are", "s": 775, "e": 777}, {"w": "on", "s": 779, "e": 781}, {"w": "screen:", "s": 784, "e": 794}, {"w": "Archivo,", "s": 803, "e": 818}, {"w": "and", "s": 829, "e": 837}, {"w": "mint", "s": 844, "e": 849}, {"w": "green.", "s": 851, "e": 861}]}, {"id": "09", "start": 881, "end": 914, "text": "Four: timing.", "words": [{"w": "Four:", "s": 881, "e": 889}, {"w": "timing.", "s": 901, "e": 914}]}, {"id": "10", "start": 926, "end": 1110, "text": "Every cue lands on the real voice, never on a guess, so the captions hit the word instead of half a second after it.", "words": [{"w": "Every", "s": 926, "e": 933}, {"w": "cue", "s": 937, "e": 943}, {"w": "lands", "s": 945, "e": 952}, {"w": "on", "s": 953, "e": 955}, {"w": "the", "s": 956, "e": 958}, {"w": "real", "s": 961, "e": 967}, {"w": "voice,", "s": 970, "e": 979}, {"w": "never", "s": 988, "e": 994}, {"w": "on", "s": 995, "e": 997}, {"w": "a", "s": 998, "e": 1000}, {"w": "guess,", "s": 1001, "e": 1010}, {"w": "so", "s": 1020, "e": 1022}, {"w": "the", "s": 1024, "e": 1026}, {"w": "captions", "s": 1028, "e": 1039}, {"w": "hit", "s": 1041, "e": 1045}, {"w": "the", "s": 1046, "e": 1049}, {"w": "word", "s": 1051, "e": 1057}, {"w": "instead", "s": 1059, "e": 1068}, {"w": "of", "s": 1069, "e": 1072}, {"w": "half", "s": 1075, "e": 1081}, {"w": "a", "s": 1082, "e": 1084}, {"w": "second", "s": 1085, "e": 1094}, {"w": "after", "s": 1097, "e": 1105}, {"w": "it.", "s": 1106, "e": 1110}]}, {"id": "11", "start": 1130, "end": 1168, "text": "Five matters most.", "words": [{"w": "Five", "s": 1130, "e": 1141}, {"w": "matters", "s": 1145, "e": 1154}, {"w": "most.", "s": 1157, "e": 1168}]}, {"id": "12", "start": 1183, "end": 1210, "text": "The never-list.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 1183, "e": 1186}, {"w": "never-list.", "s": 1190, "e": 1210}]}, {"id": "13", "start": 1227, "end": 1338, "text": "No glows. No bouncing text. Nothing on top of a hand.", "words": [{"w": "No", "s": 1227, "e": 1231}, {"w": "glows.", "s": 1233, "e": 1247}, {"w": "No", "s": 1259, "e": 1262}, {"w": "bouncing", "s": 1265, "e": 1275}, {"w": "text.", "s": 1278, "e": 1289}, {"w": "Nothing", "s": 1301, "e": 1309}, {"w": "on", "s": 1311, "e": 1314}, {"w": "top", "s": 1315, "e": 1321}, {"w": "of", "s": 1322, "e": 1324}, {"w": "a", "s": 1325, "e": 1327}, {"w": "hand.", "s": 1328, "e": 1338}]}, {"id": "14", "start": 1355, "end": 1433, "text": "Leave it out, and Claude picks everyone's default.", "words": [{"w": "Leave", "s": 1355, "e": 1359}, {"w": "it", "s": 1360, "e": 1362}, {"w": "out,", "s": 1365, "e": 1371}, {"w": "and", "s": 1379, "e": 1384}, {"w": "Claude", "s": 1387, "e": 1394}, {"w": "picks", "s": 1397, "e": 1405}, {"w": "everyone's", "s": 1407, "e": 1419}, {"w": "default.", "s": 1421, "e": 1433}]}, {"id": "15", "start": 1453, "end": 1597, "text": "Six: export. 1080 \u00d7 1920 voice at \u221214.", "words": [{"w": "Six:", "s": 1453, "e": 1462}, {"w": "export.", "s": 1474, "e": 1488}, {"w": "1080", "s": 1498, "e": 1503}, {"w": "", "s": 1507, "e": 1513}, {"w": "\u00d7", "s": 1516, "e": 1521}, {"w": "1920", "s": 1523, "e": 1533}, {"w": "", "s": 1537, "e": 1546}, {"w": "voice", "s": 1556, "e": 1566}, {"w": "at", "s": 1567, "e": 1571}, {"w": "\u221214.", "s": 1574, "e": 1581}, {"w": "", "s": 1583, "e": 1597}]}, {"id": "16", "start": 1618, "end": 1784, "text": "Then Claude writes the whole video as code and checks stills of the busiest moments before it renders anything.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "s": 1618, "e": 1622}, {"w": "Claude", "s": 1625, "e": 1634}, {"w": "writes", "s": 1635, "e": 1642}, {"w": "the", "s": 1643, "e": 1647}, {"w": "whole", "s": 1649, "e": 1654}, {"w": "video", "s": 1657, "e": 1665}, {"w": "as", "s": 1667, "e": 1671}, {"w": "code", "s": 1673, "e": 1683}, {"w": "and", "s": 1687, "e": 1690}, {"w": "checks", "s": 1692, "e": 1699}, {"w": "stills", "s": 1702, "e": 1710}, {"w": "of", "s": 1711, "e": 1713}, {"w": "the", "s": 1714, "e": 1716}, {"w": "busiest", "s": 1718, "e": 1730}, {"w": "moments", "s": 1732, "e": 1743}, {"w": "before", "s": 1744, "e": 1753}, {"w": "it", "s": 1754, "e": 1757}, {"w": "renders", "s": 1758, "e": 1769}, {"w": "anything.", "s": 1771, "e": 1784}]}, {"id": "17", "start": 1802, "end": 1847, "text": "You watch it twice on your phone.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 1802, "e": 1804}, {"w": "watch", "s": 1805, "e": 1811}, {"w": "it", "s": 1813, "e": 1816}, {"w": "twice", "s": 1819, "e": 1829}, {"w": "on", "s": 1830, "e": 1832}, {"w": "your", "s": 1834, "e": 1836}, {"w": "phone.", "s": 1837, "e": 1847}]}, {"id": "18", "start": 1859, "end": 1957, "text": "Once with sound, once without, against 8 checks.", "words": [{"w": "Once", "s": 1859, "e": 1865}, {"w": "with", "s": 1867, "e": 1871}, {"w": "sound,", "s": 1873, "e": 1883}, {"w": "once", "s": 1895, "e": 1901}, {"w": "without,", "s": 1902, "e": 1913}, {"w": "against", "s": 1922, "e": 1932}, {"w": "8", "s": 1938, "e": 1943}, {"w": "checks.", "s": 1945, "e": 1957}]}, {"id": "19", "start": 1979, "end": 2062, "text": "So the skill isn't editing. It's writing the brief.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 1979, "e": 1982}, {"w": "the", "s": 1984, "e": 1987}, {"w": "skill", "s": 1989, "e": 1999}, {"w": "isn't", "s": 2000, "e": 2008}, {"w": "editing.", "s": 2011, "e": 2023}, {"w": "It's", "s": 2030, "e": 2035}, {"w": "writing", "s": 2037, "e": 2045}, {"w": "the", "s": 2047, "e": 2050}, {"w": "brief.", "s": 2051, "e": 2062}]}, {"id": "20", "start": 2084, "end": 2174, "text": "DM me VIDEO and I'll send you the brief template and the prompts.", "words": [{"w": "DM", "s": 2084, "e": 2092}, {"w": "me", "s": 2093, "e": 2096}, {"w": "VIDEO", "s": 2098, "e": 2109}, {"w": "and", "s": 2112, "e": 2114}, {"w": "I'll", "s": 2116, "e": 2119}, {"w": "send", "s": 2121, "e": 2125}, {"w": "you", "s": 2126, "e": 2128}, {"w": "the", "s": 2129, "e": 2131}, {"w": "brief", "s": 2133, "e": 2139}, {"w": "template", "s": 2142, "e": 2153}, {"w": "and", "s": 2155, "e": 2158}, {"w": "the", "s": 2159, "e": 2161}, {"w": "prompts.", "s": 2162, "e": 2174}]}, {"id": "21", "start": 2191, "end": 2270, "text": "Hand it to Claude, and stop editing your Reels.", "words": [{"w": "Hand", "s": 2191, "e": 2196}, {"w": "it", "s": 2197, "e": 2199}, {"w": "to", "s": 2200, "e": 2203}, {"w": "Claude,", "s": 2204, "e": 2216}, {"w": "and", "s": 2222, "e": 2225}, {"w": "stop", "s": 2231, "e": 2239}, {"w": "editing", "s": 2242, "e": 2251}, {"w": "your", "s": 2252, "e": 2255}, {"w": "Reels.", "s": 2257, "e": 2270}]}], "end": 2273, "total": 2303}